o Arts"},{"animation":false,"id":238,"name":"AT-X"},{"animation":false,"id":6781,"name":"Legs"},{"animation":true,"id":6127,"name":"EGG FIRM"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Rin Namiki's greatest ambition is to follow in her late mother's footsteps and compete in Kandagawa Jet Racing, where teams of girls on jet skis race while firing high-powered water guns to slow their competitors' jets (and blow off their clothing!). But since there's no jet racing in Rin's remote fishing village, that means moving, all by herself, to a girls' school in faraway Tokyo!\n\nMeanwhile, Misa Aoi dreamed of becoming a great player, but those ambitions floundered until Rin transferred to her school, displaying astonishing skill for a newcomer. Is it fate? Now they \"only\" have to resurrect their school's Jet Riding Club, endure brutal training, and face some seriously skilled rivals… but even the toughest tasks are easier when you're doing something you love with someone who's quickly becoming far more than just a friend!\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yuri","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gyaru","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Idol","rank":48,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Kandagawa Jet Girls","english":"Kandagawa Jet Girls","native":"神田川JET GIRLS","romaji":"Kandagawa JET GIRLS","synonyms":[]},"trailer":{"id":"hbsIFTlxMFI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hbsIFTlxMFI/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}